+Switch with `/pijev assist`, `/pijev observe`, or `/pijev off`. The selection is saved as bounded Pi session metadata (`pijev-mode`, `{version: 1, mode}`), outside model context. Resume restores the most recent valid selection on the active branch; forks inherit their selected ancestry and tree navigation restores the destination mode. `PIJEV_MODE` or `--jev-mode` supplies the default only when that branch has no valid saved selection. Unknown, malformed, extra-field and unsupported-version entries are ignored. Pi saves new sessions after the first assistant response, so command-only sessions follow that normal lifecycle.
 
